### 1.3 Create Backoffice User ✅

**Endpoint:** `POST /api/auth/create-backoffice-user`  
**Access:** Public (No Authentication Required)  
**Purpose:** Create new backoffice/admin user for initial setup

**Request:**
```json
{
  "username": "admin2",
  "password": "admin123456",
  "fullName": "Admin User 2",
  "email": "admin2@evcharging.com"
}
```

**Success Response (200):**
```json
