**Frontend Integration Notes:**
- **NO TOKEN REQUIRED** - Publicly accessible for initial setup
- Validate password strength (min 6 chars) before sending
- Handle duplicate username errors
- Useful for initial system setup when no admin exists
- Role value: 0 = Backoffice

