```

**Success Response (200):**
```json
{
  "id": "5fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa8",
  "username": "operator2",
  "role": 1,
  "message": "User created successfully"
}
```

**Frontend Integration Notes:**
- Legacy endpoint - prefer the detailed endpoints above
- Useful for simple user creation scenarios

